{"seq":2,"slug":"network-api-monitoring","title":"网络与 API 监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/network-api-monitoring","wordCount":1269,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络与-api-监控\">网络与 API 监控</h1><p>移动应用的绝大多数功能依赖网络请求。用户感知到的&quot;加载慢&quot;有一半以上归因于网络链路——DNS 解析、TLS 握手、服务器处理、数据传输的任何一环出问题都会直接反映为体验劣化。网络监控的目标是将这些黑盒链路变为可观测的分段度量，让团队能快速定位&quot;到底慢在哪一段&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网络监控的核心是将一个完整的 HTTP 请求分解为可独立归因的阶段：<strong>DNS 解析</strong> → <strong>TCP 连接</strong> → <strong>TLS 握手</strong> → <strong>请求发送</strong> → <strong>TTFB（首字节等待）</strong> → <strong>数据接收</strong>。每个阶段的耗时分布和异常率独立追踪，使得&quot;慢在哪里&quot;的定位从黑盒猜测变为数据驱动的诊断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络请求生命周期度量\">网络请求生命周期度量</h2><p>一个完整的 HTTP 请求经历多个阶段，每个阶段都可能成为瓶颈：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[请求发起] --&gt; B[DNS 解析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[TCP 连接]&#10;    C --&gt; D[TLS 握手]&#10;    D --&gt; E[请求发送]&#10;    E --&gt; F[等待响应&lt;br/&gt;TTFB]&#10;    F --&gt; G[数据接收]&#10;    G --&gt; H[响应完成]&#10;&#10;    B ---|t_dns| C&#10;    C ---|t_tcp| D&#10;    D ---|t_tls| E&#10;    E ---|t_send| F&#10;    F ---|t_wait| G&#10;    G ---|t_receive| H\">flowchart LR\n    A[请求发起] --&gt; B[DNS 解析]\n    B --&gt; C[TCP 连接]\n    C --&gt; D[TLS 握手]\n    D --&gt; E[请求发送]\n    E --&gt; F[等待响应&lt;br/&gt;TTFB]\n    F --&gt; G[数据接收]\n    G --&gt; H[响应完成]\n\n    B ---|t_dns| C\n    C ---|t_tcp| D\n    D ---|t_tls| E\n    E ---|t_send| F\n    F ---|t_wait| G\n    G ---|t_receive| H</pre><p>总请求耗时的分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>dns</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>tcp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>tls</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>send</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ttfb</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>receive</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}} = T_{\\text{dns}} + T_{\\text{tcp}} + T_{\\text{tls}} + T_{\\text{send}} + T_{\\text{ttfb}} + T_{\\text{receive}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dns</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tcp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tls</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">send</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ttfb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">receive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各阶段的诊断价值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>正常范围</th>\n<th>异常可能原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DNS 解析</td>\n<td>&lt; 100ms</td>\n<td>DNS 服务器慢、未命中缓存、HTTPDNS 未生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP 连接</td>\n<td>&lt; 200ms</td>\n<td>服务器距离远、丢包率高、未复用连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TLS 握手</td>\n<td>&lt; 200ms</td>\n<td>证书链过长、未支持 TLS 1.3 session resumption</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTFB (首字节)</td>\n<td>&lt; 500ms</td>\n<td>服务端处理慢、队列拥堵、数据库查询慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据接收</td>\n<td>取决于 payload 大小</td>\n<td>带宽不足、响应体过大未压缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"平台级网络度量-api\">平台级网络度量 API</h2><h3 id=\"ios-urlsessiontaskmetrics\">iOS URLSessionTaskMetrics</h3><p>iOS 通过 <code>URLSessionTaskTransactionMetrics</code> 提供请求每阶段的精确计时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func urlSession(_ session: URLSession, task: URLSessionTask,&#10;                didFinishCollecting metrics: URLSessionTaskMetrics) {&#10;    for transaction in metrics.transactionMetrics {&#10;        let dns = transaction.domainLookupEndDate?.timeIntervalSince(&#10;            transaction.domainLookupStartDate ?? Date()) ?? 0&#10;        let tls = transaction.secureConnectionEndDate?.timeIntervalSince(&#10;            transaction.secureConnectionStartDate ?? Date()) ?? 0&#10;        let ttfb = transaction.responseStartDate?.timeIntervalSince(&#10;            transaction.requestEndDate ?? Date()) ?? 0&#10;&#10;        NetworkMonitor.report(&#10;            url: transaction.request.url,&#10;            dnsMs: dns * 1000,&#10;            tlsMs: tls * 1000,&#10;            ttfbMs: ttfb * 1000,&#10;            statusCode: (task.response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> urlSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session: URLSession, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: URLSessionTask,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                didFinishCollecting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metrics: URLSessionTaskMetrics) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transaction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metrics.transactionMetrics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dns </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transaction.domainLookupEndDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">timeIntervalSince</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            transaction.domainLookupStartDate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transaction.secureConnectionEndDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">timeIntervalSince</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            transaction.secureConnectionStartDate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ttfb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transaction.responseStartDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">timeIntervalSince</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            transaction.requestEndDate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        NetworkMonitor.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: transaction.request.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            dnsMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: dns </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            tlsMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: tls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            ttfbMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ttfb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            statusCode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (task.response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HTTPURLResponse)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.statusCode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"android-okhttp-eventlistener\">Android OkHttp EventListener</h3><p>OkHttp 的 <code>EventListener</code> 机制提供等价的分段计时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class NetworkMetricsListener : EventListener() {&#10;    private var dnsStart: Long = 0&#10;    private var connectStart: Long = 0&#10;&#10;    override fun dnsStart(call: Call, domainName: String) {&#10;        dnsStart = System.nanoTime()&#10;    }&#10;    override fun dnsEnd(call: Call, domainName: String, inetAddressList: List&lt;InetAddress&gt;) {&#10;        val dnsMs = (System.nanoTime() - dnsStart) / 1_000_000&#10;        metrics.recordDns(call.request().url, dnsMs)&#10;    }&#10;    // ... connectStart/End, secureConnectStart/End, responseHeadersStart/End&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class NetworkMetricsListener : EventListener() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var dnsStart: Long = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var connectStart: Long = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun dnsStart(call: Call, domainName: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dnsStart = System.nanoTime()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun dnsEnd(call: Call, domainName: String, inetAddressList: List&#x3C;InetAddress>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val dnsMs = (System.nanoTime() - dnsStart) / 1_000_000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        metrics.recordDns(call.request().url, dnsMs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ... connectStart/End, secureConnectStart/End, responseHeadersStart/End</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"http-错误与状态码监控\">HTTP 错误与状态码监控</h2><p>网络请求不仅有性能问题，还有正确性问题。需要监控两类错误：</p>\n<p><strong>传输层错误</strong>（请求未到达服务器）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接超时（<code>NSURLErrorTimedOut</code> / <code>SocketTimeoutException</code>）</li>\n<li>DNS 解析失败</li>\n<li>TLS 证书验证失败</li>\n<li>网络不可达</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>应用层错误</strong>（服务器返回非预期状态码）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态码范围</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>告警策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>4xx</td>\n<td>客户端错误</td>\n<td>401/403 可能是 token 过期；404 可能是 API 路径变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5xx</td>\n<td>服务端错误</td>\n<td>率 &gt; 1% 立即告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时</td>\n<td>可配置阈值（通常 30s）</td>\n<td>率 &gt; 5% 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非标准码</td>\n<td>CDN/网关自定义</td>\n<td>按业务定义处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>错误率的计算需要区分&quot;全局错误率&quot;和&quot;按 API 错误率&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>api</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>该 API 的失败请求数</mtext><mtext>该 API 的总请求数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{api}} = \\frac{\\text{该 API 的失败请求数}}{\\text{该 API 的总请求数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">api</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该</span><span class=\"mord\"> API </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的总请求数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该</span><span class=\"mord\"> API </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的失败请求数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>单个 API 的错误率突增比全局错误率更有诊断价值——它能精确定位是哪个后端服务出了问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api-响应时间的聚合与告警\">API 响应时间的聚合与告警</h2><p>响应时间的统计必须使用百分位数而非平均值。平均值会被少数极端值拉偏，掩盖真实的用户体验分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Apdex</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Apdex} = \\frac{S + \\frac{T}{2}}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Apdex</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2933em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6073em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.735em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> = 满意请求数（响应时间 &lt; 阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> = 容忍请求数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> &lt; 响应时间 &lt; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> = 总请求数。Apdex 得分范围 [0, 1]，行业标准：&gt; 0.9 为优秀，&lt; 0.7 需要干预。</p>\n<p>Sentry 和 Firebase Performance 都提供按 endpoint 聚合的响应时间分布：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始请求数据] --&gt; B[按 URL pattern 聚合&lt;br/&gt;/api/v2/products/:id]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算分位数&lt;br/&gt;P50/P75/P90/P99]&#10;    C --&gt; D[版本间对比]&#10;    D --&gt; E{退化检测}&#10;    E --&gt;|P90 增长&gt;30%| F[触发告警]&#10;    E --&gt;|正常| G[存入时序数据库]&#10;    F --&gt; H[关联到版本/设备/地区]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始请求数据] --&gt; B[按 URL pattern 聚合&lt;br/&gt;/api/v2/products/:id]\n    B --&gt; C[计算分位数&lt;br/&gt;P50/P75/P90/P99]\n    C --&gt; D[版本间对比]\n    D --&gt; E{退化检测}\n    E --&gt;|P90 增长&gt;30%| F[触发告警]\n    E --&gt;|正常| G[存入时序数据库]\n    F --&gt; H[关联到版本/设备/地区]</pre><h2 id=\"弱网环境模拟与监控\">弱网环境模拟与监控</h2><p>移动端的网络环境极不稳定——地铁、电梯、偏远地区的弱网场景是日常。需要在两个层面处理弱网：</p>\n<p><strong>开发阶段</strong>：使用 Network Link Conditioner（iOS）/ 自定义 OkHttp Interceptor（Android）模拟弱网，确保应用在高延迟、高丢包环境下不崩溃、不无限 loading。</p>\n<p><strong>线上监控</strong>：按网络类型（WiFi/4G/3G/2G）分组统计请求成功率和延迟分布。弱网用户的指标应单独追踪，避免与 WiFi 用户的数据混在一起拉低整体告警阈值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络类型</th>\n<th>典型延迟</th>\n<th>可接受 P90</th>\n<th>超时设置建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WiFi</td>\n<td>50-200ms</td>\n<td>1s</td>\n<td>15s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4G/LTE</td>\n<td>100-500ms</td>\n<td>2s</td>\n<td>20s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3G</td>\n<td>300-1500ms</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2G/EDGE</td>\n<td>1000-5000ms</td>\n<td>10s</td>\n<td>45s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"网络监控与其他维度的关联\">网络监控与其他维度的关联</h2><p>网络请求的耗时直接影响<a href=\"app-launch-metrics\">启动性能度量</a>——冷启动期间的首屏 API 请求往往是 TTFD 的瓶颈。当某个 API 的 P90 响应时间突增时，还需要检查是否因此触发了客户端超时重试，进而引发<a href=\"memory-battery-profiling\">内存与电量</a>的异常消耗（重试风暴导致 CPU 和网络持续占用）。</p>\n<p>从告警运营的角度，网络错误率是<a href=\"../platform-operations/alerting-incident-response\">告警与应急响应</a>的核心数据源之一——5xx 突增通常是后端事故的最早信号，比后端自身的监控（依赖日志聚合）更快被客户端 SDK 捕获。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网络监控将 HTTP 请求从端到端黑盒转化为可分段归因的透明链路。iOS 的 URLSessionTaskMetrics 和 Android 的 OkHttp EventListener 提供毫秒级阶段计时。错误率按 API 独立追踪比全局聚合更有诊断价值。Apdex 评分量化用户对响应速度的满意度。弱网环境需要按网络类型分层监控，避免 WiFi 用户的数据稀释弱网问题的严重性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网络与 API 监控","id":"网络与-api-监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网络请求生命周期度量","id":"网络请求生命周期度量"},{"level":2,"text":"平台级网络度量 API","id":"平台级网络度量-api"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS URLSessionTaskMetrics","id":"ios-urlsessiontaskmetrics"},{"level":3,"text":"Android OkHttp EventListener","id":"android-okhttp-eventlistener"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP 错误与状态码监控","id":"http-错误与状态码监控"},{"level":2,"text":"API 响应时间的聚合与告警","id":"api-响应时间的聚合与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"弱网环境模拟与监控","id":"弱网环境模拟与监控"},{"level":2,"text":"网络监控与其他维度的关联","id":"网络监控与其他维度的关联"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"启动性能度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/app-launch-metrics"},"next":{"title":"内存与电量分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/memory-battery-profiling"}}